    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01226",
        "explanation": "Final doctor-facing closure instructions covered medication adherence, wound boundaries, dental follow-up, and emergency return signals.",
        "quote": "不要自己拆敷料或碰引流口"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01248",
        "explanation": "Caregiver confirmed an executable home plan and red-flag escalation after discharge.",
        "quote": "按药袋标签吃"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode closed after definitive offline evaluation, drainage, inpatient reassessment, discharge teaching, and post-discharge monitoring. Residual uncertainty about full report details and ongoing dental source management was made safe by concrete follow-up, medication-label adherence, wound-care boundaries, and immediate return thresholds.",
