        "quote": "您可以这样温和但坚定地劝她"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00828",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted to caregiver uncertainty about drug names by anchoring execution to labels and discharge paperwork.",
        "quote": "按出院小结上写的次数和天数吃完"
      }
    ]
  },
