        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by low-grade temperature and apparently reassuring status. The doctor neither diagnosed sepsis/eye infection online nor reassured the family that normal-ish vitals were safe; instead, the doctor repeatedly required CT/labs/specialist assessment and in-hospital monitoring.",
