          "explanation": "When post-discharge fever, worse swelling and malodorous drainage appeared, the doctor escalated from home execution to immediate hospital contact/ED.",
          "quote": "不能继续在家观察"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00960",
          "explanation": "The family acted on that escalation and returned for emergency reassessment.",
          "quote": "没有再在家等"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered repeatedly as symptoms changed. The doctor clearly distinguished monitoring while stable from immediate escalation for high fever/chills, worsening swelling, eye/airway/swallowing/mental-status changes, bleeding or drainage problems, and this directly changed the trajectory when the patient returned to care after discharge.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
